  "descriptionHtml": "<p><strong id=\"docs-internal-guid-dda8a840-7fff-ffb7-ea26-56e93b1ac711\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXf9S-UlLFleWckvRSL5nVyNhrynrd2ajdNBJVTVH_deRht58lD3c9Ea-_psUJqXSFOOiyEIQTmwOOtkDSlY7St8knJzBTgttB2a763hKMwihmmxUWZ13XUZp1LAEMygtHtdQPRMpADtmk7_PqZpdSmtgU8?key=LXqd2muEJS6H2Lk_yKP26Q\" width=\"462\" height=\"308\"></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The session aimed to provide students with valuable insights into the future of Data Networking &amp; Video Transmission. The speaker was an experienced professional from broadcast technology, who shared his knowledge and expertise on the topic and attendees had the opportunity to interact with the speakers through a Q&amp;A session.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong id=\"docs-internal-guid-48be4b12-7fff-4fa1-cfe0-34830f4ac229\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXc3oWhHkavoA6HupEnw2_m3sQz3quCzc983lK02IK2488GyCqWiXrdG-1lSRsgtpnX66DkjnKUClJByvUFN2TQfl87dJNPTocFyxnCSVuH2QToq1hMGmw6t7FXyjFvvBNb3GEfDdOltkqmktEfG5G1IJH6H?key=LXqd2muEJS6H2Lk_yKP26Q\" width=\"320\" height=\"213\"><strong id=\"docs-internal-guid-966e87a8-7fff-7927-0ecb-4470e6c6b789\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXd9Uu2gvrl5d_mv0DwQuvnMAR74orhMyJwEy0_0mFq6zTA0U2OeXAnp7Cpb38_f-5jpyywrMI_ShhDknFzP0e8GYEEP0gVqHt6gtNzc5JdiXl7SxT0hulo7_iK8XYyM773mymuQrXDBrnsVZmyBgKF3eK2N?key=LXqd2muEJS6H2Lk_yKP26Q\" width=\"317\" height=\"211\"><strong id=\"docs-internal-guid-7d2a0543-7fff-e5d8-1a2a-ae748231c411\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXcpdSr8Q0J46DUps3ejtxbWScXNLlC1jhAlHRxcx6OfwfrzBaJ4vvjf5eVZIDeWECAhfEwqz0BBS7E9gOlbJ2PDDtPI1k5ZiI_ICYz1-EjnuTFXIuFN1luGzaVmgCNBTSB0hVZfha1oaWxRIDhvvU-moG_5?key=LXqd2muEJS6H2Lk_yKP26Q\" width=\"320\" height=\"213\"></strong></strong></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><strong><stro